INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('lsimatt2/resisters/upload', 'upload', 'lsimatt2', 'resisters', 'community', 'upload lsimatt2 resisters community The upload skill automates deployment to Vercel by committing and pushing changes via Git. It benefits developers by simplifying the deployment process. Upload功能允许您将更改部署到Vercel，包括运行git状态检查、提交和推送 Upload機能は、変更をVercelにデプロイすることを可能にします。gitの状態チェック、コミット、プッシュなど Upload기능을 사용하면 변경 사항을 Vercel에 배포할 수 있습니다. git 상태 체크, 커밋, 푸시 등 El upload a Vercel es un proceso que implica commit y push de cambios para desplegar sitios web. Utiliza herramientas de AI para automatizar el proceso L''upload sur Vercel est un processus qui implique commit et push de modifications pour déployer des sites web. Utilisez des outils d''IA pour automatiser le processus Der Upload auf Vercel ist ein Prozess, der Commit und Push von Änderungen zum Deployen von Webseiten beinhaltet. Verwenden Sie KI-Tools, um den Prozess zu automatisieren O upload para Vercel é um processo que envolve o uso de comandos git para commitar e enviar alterações. Confira nosso guia para saber mais. Upload на Vercel - это процесс, включающий использование команд git для фиксации и отправки изменений. Узнайте больше из нашего руководства. أداة الرفع إلى Vercel هي عملية تستخدم أوامر git لتقديم وتسليم التغييرات. راجع دليلنا لمعرفة المزيد. how to use upload upload setup guide git add command vercel deployment automation upload vs manual deployment upload install for ai agents what is upload skill upload alternative for developers automated git push Upload功能 Vercel部署 git操作 自动部署 Web开发 AIエージェント Upload.setup Vercel deploying Runs git status and git diff to review changes Stages changed files with git add for precise control Writes clear, concise commit messages for version tracking Commits changes with a meaningful message and pushes to origin main Confirms deployment to Vercel for streamlined updates Upload is a skill that automates the deployment of site changes to Vercel via Git, using commands like git add and git push.');
