INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('AhmedAlnasser2000/Science-Lab/physicslab_worktrees', 'physicslab_worktrees', 'AhmedAlnasser2000', 'Science-Lab', 'community', 'physicslab_worktrees AhmedAlnasser2000 Science-Lab community The physicslab_worktrees skill enables developers to create new worktrees and manage branches efficiently. It automates tasks such as starting new slice/milestone branches and reminding users about best practices. PhysicsLab Worktrees 是一个用于创建和管理工作树的工具，支持分支管理和安全默认设置 PhysicsLab Worktrees は、新しいスライス/マイルストーン ブランチを作成し、ワークツリーを安全に管理するためのツールです PhysicsLab Worktrees는 작업을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있는 작업 트리 및 분기 관리 도구입니다 PhysicsLab Worktrees es una herramienta para crear ramas y trabajar de forma efectiva con Git. Permite a los desarrolladores crear worktrees y trabajar en ellos de forma segura. PhysicsLab Worktrees est un outil pour créer des branches et travailler efficacement avec Git. Il permet aux développeurs de créer des worktrees et de travailler dessus de manière sécurisée. PhysicsLab Worktrees ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von Branches und effektiver Arbeit mit Git. Es ermöglicht Entwicklern, Worktrees zu erstellen und sicher darin zu arbeiten. O PhysicsLab Worktrees é uma ferramenta para criar branches e worktrees de forma eficiente, com recursos como start de branches com segurança e lembretes para desenvolvedores PhysicsLab Worktrees - это инструмент для создания веток и рабочих деревьев, обеспечивающий безопасный старт веток и напоминания для разработчиков ИИ Агентов PhysicsLab Worktrees هو أداة لإنشاء فروع ووحدات عمل بشكل فعال، مع ميزات مثل بدء الفروع بأمان وتذكيرات لمنشئي الأدوات الذكية how to use physicslab_worktrees physicslab_worktrees setup guide physicslab_worktrees alternative physicslab_worktrees vs git worktree physicslab_worktrees install physicslab_worktrees tutorial worktree management with physicslab_worktrees physicslab_worktrees best practices physicslab_worktrees and PowerShell PhysicsLab Worktrees 工作树管理 分支管理 powershell 脚本 安全默认设置 fetch 和 ff-only pull AI 工具 AI 에이전트 Starts new slice/milestone branches using PowerShell scripts Creates worktrees with safe defaults and no push enabled Reminds users to work inside the created worktree folder Enforces fetch and fast-forward only pull for local main vs origin Supports explicit push requests using the -Push flag Utilizes powershell ./tools/dev/start_slice_worktree.ps1 script for automation physicslab_worktrees is a skill that automates worktree management, allowing developers to create and manage new branches and worktrees using PowerShell scripts.');
