INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('mvappshub/chalange/observability-guidelines', 'observability-guidelines', 'mvappshub', 'chalange', 'community', 'observability-guidelines mvappshub chalange community The observability-guidelines skill ensures comprehensive visibility into distributed systems and microservices by applying core observability principles and integrating OpenTelemetry. This benefits developers working with complex systems. 可观测性指南提供了确保分布式系统和微服务全面可见性的原则，包括使用 OpenTelemetry 和 Clean Architecture 可観測性ガイドは、分散システムとマイクロサービスの全面的な可視性を確保するための原則を提供します。OpenTelemetry と Clean Architecture を使用します 관측 가능성 가이드는 분산 시스템과 마이크로 서비스의 전체적인 가시성을 확보하는 원칙을 제공합니다. OpenTelemetry와 Clean Architecture를 사용합니다 Aplica principios de observabilidad para obtener visibilidad completa en sistemas distribuidos y microservices Assurez-vous une visibilité complète dans les systèmes distribués et les microservices avec les principes d''observabilité Wenden Sie Observability-Prinzipien an, um umfassende Sichtbarkeit in verteilten Systemen und Microservices zu erhalten As diretrizes de observabilidade fornecem princípios para desenvolver código com visibilidade integrada, modular e de alto desempenho com OpenTelemetry Руководство по наблюдаемости предлагает принципы для разработки кода с встроенной наблюдаемостью, модульной конструкции и высокой производительностью с OpenTelemetry إرشادات المراقبة توفر مبادئ لتطوير رمز مع رؤية مدمجة وتصميم موديولار وعالية الأداء مع OpenTelemetry how to use observability-guidelines what is observability-guidelines observability-guidelines alternative observability-guidelines vs OpenTracing observability-guidelines install observability-guidelines setup guide OpenTelemetry integration tutorial distributed system observability best practices microservices monitoring with observability-guidelines 可观测性指南 分布式系统 微服务 OpenTelemetry Clean Architecture 测试驱动开发 可观测性 AIエージェント 开发最佳实践 Applies core observability principles for idiomatic, maintainable, and high-performance code Enforces modular design and separation of concerns through Clean Architecture Promotes test-driven development and robust observability from the start Integrates OpenTelemetry for distributed system visibility Guides development of built-in observability for comprehensive system insights Supports development of high-performance code with built-in observability Observability-guidelines is a set of principles and guidelines for ensuring comprehensive visibility into distributed systems and microservices, promoting modular design and test-driven development');
