pest is a specialist skill for converting PHPUnit test classes to PEST syntax, following specific testing rules and constraints.","zh":"rewrite-tests-pest是一种将PHPUnit测试类转换为PEST语法的技能","ja":"rewrite-tests-pestは、PHPUnitテストクラスをPESTシンタックスに変換するスキルです","ko":"rewrite-tests-pest는 PHPUnit 테스트 클래스를 PEST 문법으로 변환하는 기술입니다","es":"Rewrite-tests-pest es una herramienta de AI Agents que convierte clases de prueba de PHPUnit a sintaxis PEST","fr":"Rewrite-tests-pest est un outil d''AI Tools qui convertit les classes de test PHPUnit en syntaxe PEST","de":"Rewrite-tests-pest ist ein AI-Tool, das PHPUnit-Testklassen in PEST-Syntax umwandelt","pt":"O rewrite-tests-pest é um agente de migração de testes que converte classes de teste PHPUnit para PEST.","ru":"Агент rewrite-tests-pest является агентом миграции тестов, который конвертирует классы тестов PHPUnit в PEST.","ar":"العميل rewrite-tests-pest هو عامل تحويل الاختبارات الذي يحول فئات الاختبار PHPUnit إلى PEST"},"features":{"en":["Converts PHPUnit test classes to PEST syntax","Applies testing rules from .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc and .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc","Ensures 100% coverage for changed code","Adds missing tests if needed","Loads rules from .cursor/rules/php/standard"],"zh":["将PHPUnit测试类转换为PEST语法","应用测试规则以确保100%代码覆盖率","加载.cursor/rules/php/standard规则","加载.cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc规则","确保测试代码不修改生产代码"],"ja":["PHPUnitテストクラスをPESTシンタックスに変換","テストルールを適用して100%のコードカバレッジを確保",".cursor/rules/php/standardルールをロード",".cursor/rules/php-testing.mdcルールをロード","テストコードが生産コードを変更しないことを確認"],"ko":["PHPUnit 테스트 클래스를 PEST 문법으로 변환","테스트 규칙을 적용하여 100% 코드 커버리지 보장",".cursor/rules/php/standard 규칙 로드",".cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc 규칙 로드","테스트 코드가 생산 코드를 변경하지 않는지 확인"],"es":["Conversión de clases de prueba de PHPUnit a sintaxis PEST","Aplicación de reglas de testing de `.cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc` y `.cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc`","Mejora de la cobertura de pruebas al 100% para el código modificado","Adición de pruebas faltantes si es necesario","Respeto de la integridad del código de producción"],"fr":["Conversion des classes de test PHPUnit en syntaxe PEST","Application des règles de testing de `.cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc` et `.cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc`","Amélioration de la couverture des tests à 100% pour le code modifié","Ajout de tests manquants si nécessaire","Respect de l''intégrité du code de production"],"de":["Umwandlung von PHPUnit-Testklassen in PEST-Syntax","Anwendung von Testregeln aus `.cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc` und `.cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc`","Verbesserung der Testabdeckung auf 100% für den modifizierten Code","Hinzufügen fehlender Tests wenn erforderlich","Einhalten der Integrität des Produktionscodes"],"pt":["Converte classes de teste PHPUnit para sintaxe PEST","Aplica regras de teste do arquivo .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc","Garante 100% de cobertura de código alterado","Adiciona testes faltantes se necessário","Não modifica o código de produção"],"ru":["Конвертирует классы тестов PHPUnit в синтаксис PEST","Применяет правила тестирования из файла .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc","Обеспечивает 100% покрытие измененного кода","Добавляет缺ующие тесты при необходимости","Не изменяет код производственной среды"],"ar":["يحول فئات الاختبار PHPUnit إلى بناء جملة PEST","يطبق قواعد الاختبار من الملف .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc","يضمن تغطية 100% للكود المعدل","يضيف الاختبارات الناقصة إذا لزم الأمر","لا يغير الكود الإنتاجي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use rewrite-tests-pest","what is rewrite-tests-pest","rewrite-tests-pest alternative","rewrite-tests-pest vs PHPUnit","rewrite-tests-pest install","rewrite-tests-pest setup guide","PEST syntax conversion","PHPUnit test conversion"],"zh":["rewrite-tests-pest","PHPUnit","PEST","测试规则","代码覆盖率","PHP","测试自动化","代码转换"],"ja":["rewrite-tests-pest","PHPUnit","PEST","テストルール","コードカバレッジ","PHP","テスト自動化","コード変換"],"ko":["rewrite-tests-pest","PHPUnit","PEST","테스트 규칙","코드 커버리지","PHP","테스트 자동화","코드 변환"],"es":["rewrite-tests-pest","conversión de PHPUnit a PEST","herramientas de AI Agents","mejora de la cobertura de pruebas","reglas de testing","PEST syntax","PHPUnit testing"],"fr":["rewrite-tests-pest","conversion de PHPUnit en PEST","outils d''AI Tools","amélioration de la couverture des tests","règles de testing","syntaxe PEST","testing PHPUnit"],"de":["rewrite-tests-pest","Umwandlung von PHPUnit in PEST","AI-Tools","Verbesserung der Testabdeckung","Testregeln","PEST-Syntax","PHPUnit-Testing"],"pt":["rewrite-tests-pest","migração de testes","PHPUnit","PEST","cobertura de código","testes automatizados","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de teste","agente de migração de testes"],"ru":["rewrite-tests-pest","миграция тестов","PHPUnit","PEST","покрытие кода","автоматизированное тестирование","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты тестирования","агент миграции тестов"],"ar":["rewrite-tests-pest","تحويل الاختبارات","PHPUnit","PEST","تغطية الكود","اختبارات آلية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات الاختبار","عامل تحويل الاختبارات"]}},"owner":"pekral","repo":"pint-rules","repoPath":"pekral/pint-rules","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.625Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"rewrite-tests-pest","description":"Rewrites existing PHPUnit-style tests to PEST syntax following project testing rules. Use when the user wants to convert tests to PEST, rewrite tests to PEST syntax, or migrate PHPUnit tests to Pest. Ensures 100% coverage after rewrite.","bodyPreview":"# Rewrite Tests to PEST Syntax\n\nSpecialist for converting PHPUnit test classes to PEST syntax. Apply testing rules from `.cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc` (Testing section) and `.cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc`. Never modify production code. After rewrite, coverage must be 100% for changed code; add missing tests if needed.\n\n**Role:** Rewrite tests only. Apply all project test rules.\n**Constraint:** Tests only. Never modify production code.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Load Rules\n\n- Read `.cursor/rules/php/standard","body":"# Rewrite Tests to PEST Syntax\n\nSpecialist for converting PHPUnit test classes to PEST syntax. Apply testing rules from `.cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc` (Testing section) and `.cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc`. Never modify production code. After rewrite, coverage must be 100% for changed code; add missing tests if needed.\n\n**Role:** Rewrite tests only. Apply all project test rules.\n**Constraint:** Tests only. Never modify production code.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Load Rules\n\n- Read `.cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc` (focus: Testing, Bug-Fix Workflow, Naming, Structure).\n- Read `.cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc` (analysis, mocking, asserts, coverage, running tests).\n\n---\n\n## 2. Prerequisites\n\n- Run only if Pest is installed (`pestphp/pest` in `composer.json` or `vendor/bin/pest` exists).\n- If Pest is not installed, do not rewrite; inform the user.\n\n---\n\n## 3. PHPUnit → PEST Mapping\n\n| PHPUnit | PEST |\n|--------|------|\n| `final class FooTest extends TestCase` | Remove class; use one or more test files (e.g. `tests/FooTest.php` or feature-based files). |\n| `public function testSomething(): void` | `test(''something does something'', function (): void { ... });` or `it(''does something'', function (): void { ... });` |\n| `$this->assertSame($a, $b)` | `expect($a)->toBe($b)` (or `toEqual` for loose comparison) |\n| `$this->assertTrue($x)` | `expect($x)->toBeTrue()` |\n| `$this->assertFalse($x)` | `expect($x)->toBeFalse()` |\n| `$this->assertInstanceOf(Class::class, $x)` | `expect($x)->toBeInstanceOf(Class::class)` |\n| `$this->assertCount($n, $iterable)` | `expect($iterable)->toHaveCount($n)` |\n| `$this->assertContains($needle, $haystack)` | `expect($haystack)->toContain($needle)` |\n| `$this->assertEmpty($x)` | `expect($x)->toBeEmpty()` |\n| `$this->expectException(Ex::class)` | `expect(fn () => ...)->toThrow(Ex::class)` or catch in test and assert |\n| Data provider `@dataProvider foo` | `test(''...'', function (mixed $a, mixed $b): void { ... })->with([...])` or `dataset(''name'', [...])` |\n\n- Test description: first argument of `test(''...'')` or `it(''...'')` — human-readable, describes behavior.\n- Use local variables only; no test class properties.\n- Shared setup: use `beforeEach()` in the same file or in `tests/Pest.php` if project uses it.\n- Keep helpers in same file or in `tests/Pest.php` as plain functions if already used elsewhere.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Workflow\n\n1. **Identify scope**  \n   Target file(s): PHPUnit test classes (e.g. `*Test.php` extending `TestCase`). Optionally one PEST file per original class or one file per feature.\n\n2. **Analyse**  \n   - List all test methods and assertions.  \n   - Note data providers, `setUp`/`tearDown`, and shared state.  \n   - Check which code is covered (existing coverage report or run coverage for that file).\n\n3. **Rewrite**  \n   - Replace class with `test()` / `it()` calls.  \n   - Convert `$this->assert*` to `expect()->...`.  \n   - Convert data providers to `->with()` or `dataset()`.  \n   - Move `setUp` logic into `beforeEach()` or into each test; avoid class state.  \n   - Keep test data in English; keep names descriptive.\n\n4. **Coverage**  \n   - Run tests for changed files.  \n   - Run coverage (e.g. Clover XML) for the code exercised by those tests.  \n   - If coverage for changed production code is below 100%, add or adjust tests until 100%.\n\n5. **Cleanup**  \n   - Remove generated coverage artifacts when done.  \n   - Run project fixers (e.g. composer scripts, PHP CS) if available.  \n   - Delete obsolete PHPUnit-only boilerplate (e.g. empty class) if the file is now fully PEST.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Conventions (from project rules)\n\n- Arrange–act–assert; error cases first, success last.\n- Mock only external services (e.g. HTTP); use Mockery or framework fakes (e.g. `Http::fake()`).\n- No tests for abstract/private/protected implementation details; test public behaviour.\n- Final test classes: in PEST there is no class; keep test file and descriptions clear.\n- Data providers via argument (e.g. `->with([...])`), not PHPDoc.\n- Run tests only for changed files; check coverage only for changed code.\n\n---\n\n## 6. After Rewrite\n\n- Run tests for the rewritten files.  \n- Ensure 100% coverage for any changed production code; add tests if needed.  \n- Remove coverage output files.  \n- Run fixers if the project defines them.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:13:34.005Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for PHP-centric AI Agents requiring automated test conversion and validation, such as Cursor or AutoGPT, to streamline PHPUnit to PEST syntax transitions.","zh":"适合于需要自动化测试转换和验证的PHP中心AI代理，例如Cursor或AutoGPT，以简化PHPUnit到PEST语法转换。","ja":"PHPUnitからPESTへのシンタックス移行を簡素化するために、CursorやAutoGPTなどの自動テスト変換と検証を必要とするPHP中心のAIエージェントに適しています。","ko":"PHPUnit에서 PEST로의 문법 전환을 간소화하기 위해 Cursor나 AutoGPT와 같은 자동 테스트 변환 및 검증이 필요한 PHP 중심 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial centrados en PHP que requieren conversión y validación de pruebas automatizadas, como Cursor o AutoGPT, para simplificar las transiciones de sintaxis de PHPUnit a PEST.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle axés sur PHP nécessitant une conversion et une validation de tests automatisés, tels que Cursor ou AutoGPT, pour simplifier les transitions de syntaxe de PHPUnit à PEST.","de":"Ideal für PHP-zentrierte KI-Agents, die eine automatisierte Testumwandlung und -validierung benötigen, wie z. B. Cursor oder AutoGPT, um den Übergang von PHPUnit zu PEST-Syntax zu vereinfachen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA centrados em PHP que exigem conversão e validação de teste automatizadas, como Cursor ou AutoGPT, para simplificar transições de sintaxe de PHPUnit para PEST.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на PHP, требующих автоматического преобразования и проверки тестов, таких как Cursor или AutoGPT, чтобы упростить переход от синтаксиса PHPUnit к PEST.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين المتمركزين في PHP الذين يتطلبون تحويل اختبار و التحقق التلقائي ، مثل Cursor أو AutoGPT ، لتبسيط انتقالات بناء الجملة من PHPUnit إلى PEST."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert PHPUnit test classes to PEST syntax seamlessly, applying standards from .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc and .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc, ensuring 100% coverage for changed code without altering production code, leveraging PHP and PHPUnit expertise.","zh":"赋予代理将PHPUnit测试类转换为PEST语法的能力，应用.cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc和.cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc中的标准，确保更改代码的100%覆盖率而不修改生产代码，利用PHP和PHPUnit的专业知识。","ja":"PHPUnitテストクラスをPESTシンタックスにシームレスに変換するエージェントを可能にし、.cursor/rules/php/standards.mdcおよび.cursor/rules/php-testing.mdcからの規格を適用し、生産コードを変更せずに変更されたコードの100%のカバレッジを確保し、PHPおよびPHPUnitの専門知識を活用します。","ko":"PHPUnit 테스트 클래스를 PEST 문법으로 무중단으로 변환하는 에이전트를 가능하게 하며, .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc 및 .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc의 표준을 적용하여 생산 코드를 수정하지 않고 변경된 코드의 100% 커버리지를 보장하며, PHP 및 PHPUnit 전문 지식을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir clases de pruebas de PHPUnit a sintaxis de PEST de forma fluida, aplicando estándares de .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc y .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc, garantizando una cobertura del 100% para el código modificado sin alterar el código de producción, aprovechando la experiencia en PHP y PHPUnit.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir des classes de test PHPUnit en syntaxe PEST de manière fluide, en appliquant des normes de .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc et .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc, garantissant une couverture de 100% pour le code modifié sans altérer le code de production, en exploitant l''expertise en PHP et PHPUnit.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, PHPUnit-Testklassen in PEST-Syntax reibungslos umzuwandeln, indem Standards von .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc und .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc angewendet werden, um eine Abdeckung von 100% für den geänderten Code ohne Änderung des Produktionscodes sicherzustellen, indem PHP- und PHPUnit-Expertise genutzt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter classes de teste do PHPUnit para a sintaxe do PEST de forma transparente, aplicando padrões de .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc e .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc, garantindo 100% de cobertura para o código alterado sem alterar o código de produção, aproveitando a expertise em PHP e PHPUnit.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать классы тестов PHPUnit в синтаксис PEST бесшовно, применяя стандарты из .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc и .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc, обеспечивая 100% покрытие для измененного кода без изменения кода производства, используя экспертизу PHP и PHPUnit.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحويل فصول اختبار PHPUnit إلى بناء الجملة PEST بطريقة متسلسلة ، بتطبيق المعايير من .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc و .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc ، وضمان تغطية 100٪ للكود المعدل دون تغيير كود الإنتاج ، واستخدام الخبرة في PHP و PHPUnit."},"useCases":{"en":["Converting legacy PHPUnit tests to PEST for improved maintainability","Automating test validation against project-specific testing rules","Ensuring 100% test coverage for modified codebases"],"zh":["将遗留的PHPUnit测试转换为PEST以提高可维护性","自动验证测试是否符合项目特定的测试规则","确保修改的代码库的100%测试覆盖率"],"ja":["従来のPHPUnitテストをPESTに変換してメンテナンス性を向上させる","プロジェクト固有のテストルールに対するテストの自動検証","変更されたコードベースの100%テストカバレッジを確保する"],"ko":["유지 보수성을 개선하기 위해 기존 PHPUnit 테스트를 PEST로 변환하는 것","프로젝트 특정 테스트 규칙에 대한 테스트 자동 검증","변경된 코드베이스에 대한 100% 테스트 커버리지를 보장하는 것"],"es":["Conversión de pruebas heredadas de PHPUnit a PEST para mejorar la mantenibilidad","Automatización de la validación de pruebas contra reglas de prueba específicas del proyecto","Garantía de una cobertura de pruebas del 100% para bases de código modificadas"],"fr":["Conversion de tests hérités de PHPUnit en PEST pour améliorer la maintenabilité","Automatisation de la validation de tests contre des règles de test spécifiques au projet","Garantie d''une couverture de tests de 100% pour des bases de code modifiées"],"de":["Umwandlung von veralteten PHPUnit-Tests in PEST für verbesserte Wartbarkeit","Automatisierung der Testvalidierung gegen projektspezifische Testregeln","Sicherstellung einer Testabdeckung von 100% für geänderte Codebasen"],"pt":["Conversão de testes legados do PHPUnit para PEST para melhor manutenibilidade","Automatização da validação de testes contra regras de teste específicas do projeto","Garantia de 100% de cobertura de testes para bases de código modificadas"],"ru":["Преобразование устаревших тестов PHPUnit в PEST для улучшения поддерживаемости","Автоматизация проверки тестов против проектных правил тестирования","Обеспечение 100% покрытия тестов для измененных баз кода"],"ar":["تحويل اختبارات PHPUnit القديمة إلى PEST لتحسين الصيانة","أتمتة التحقق من اختبارات ضد قواعد الاختبار الخاصة بالمشروع","ضمان تغطية 100٪ لاختبارات قواعد الكود المعدلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Limited to PHPUnit test classes","Requires access to .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc and .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc","Does not modify production code"],"zh":["仅限于PHPUnit测试类","需要访问.cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc和.cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc","不修改生产代码"],"ja":["PHPUnitテストクラスのみに限定される",".cursor/rules/php/standards.mdcおよび.cursor/rules/php-testing.mdcへのアクセスが必要","生産コードを変更しない"],"ko":["PHPUnit 테스트 클래스만 해당",".cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc 및 .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc에 접근해야 함","생산 코드를 수정하지 않음"],"es":["Limitado a clases de pruebas de PHPUnit","Requiere acceso a .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc y .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc","No modifica el código de producción"],"fr":["Limité aux classes de test PHPUnit","Nécessite un accès à .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc et .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc","Ne modifie pas le code de production"],"de":["Begrenzt auf PHPUnit-Testklassen","Benötigt Zugriff auf .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc und .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc","Ändert den Produktionscode nicht"],"pt":["Limitado a classes de teste do PHPUnit","Exige acesso a .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc e .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc","Não modifica o código de produção"],"ru":["Ограничен классами тестов PHPUnit","Требует доступа к .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc и .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc","Не изменяет код производства"],"ar":["محدود بالفصول الدراسية لاختبار PHPUnit","يتطلب الوصول إلى .cursor/rules/php/standards.mdc و .cursor/rules/php-testing.mdc","لا يغير كود الإنتاج"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"57b8a85d72ee664cd3b9194dabfc981f725abe092af9f4fd56dfec89fec647d4","qualityScore":23}');
